      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽说是模拟赛，但仍是一种比赛。\n与平时的训练同时进行的话，\n将会相当消耗体力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf98a1be0bc4f2e48e94da614248e798e08a6072ff546ffada710ad355190a18",
